{
 "name": "Contract Exam Exclusions List",
 "content": "<h1><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Contract Examination Exclusions</span></span></h1><div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Circumstances under which contract examinations <em><strong>must not </strong></em>be requested include, but are not limited to, the following:</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></div><ul>\t<li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Former Prisoner of War (FPOW) Protocol Examination is required</span></span></li>\t<li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">examination requires hospitalization or surgical evaluation, such as colonoscopy or laparoscopy</span></span></li>\t<li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Veteran is an inpatient at a Veterans Health Administration (VHA) facility, nursing home, extended care facility, or domiciliary, and</span></span></li>\t<li><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Veteran is an employee of the contract examination vendor scheduled to conduct the examination.</span></span></li></ul><div><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><em><strong>Reference</strong></em>:&nbsp; For more information on examination requests, see <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000180498\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part IV, Subpart i, Chapter 2, Section A - Examination Requests Overview\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000180498?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">M21-1, Part IV, Subpart i, 2.A</a>.</span></span></div>",
